#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:2
msgid "Integrations: MCP, Skills, Browser, and Documentation"
msgstr "集成：MCP、Skill、浏览器与文档"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:4
msgid ""
"Integrations extend what Studio can inspect or do. Enable only the "
"services you understand and keep their scope narrow."
msgstr "集成会扩展 Studio 可以检查或执行的内容。只启用你理解的服务，并将其范围保持在最小。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:8
msgid "MCP servers"
msgstr "MCP server"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:10
msgid ""
"Use **Settings > MCP Servers** to add or manage custom MCP servers. "
"Before enabling a server, review:"
msgstr "使用 **Settings > MCP Servers** 添加或管理自定义 MCP server。启用 server 前，请检查："

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:13
msgid "its URL or local command;"
msgstr "它的 URL 或本地命令；"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:14
msgid "environment variables and headers;"
msgstr "环境变量和 headers；"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:15
msgid "the tools it exposes and their likely side effects;"
msgstr "它提供的工具及其可能的副作用；"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:16
msgid "whether calls will require approval;"
msgstr "调用是否需要审批；"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:17
msgid "whether the server is local, trusted, and maintained by someone you trust."
msgstr "server 是否为本地、可信，并由你信任的人维护。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:19
msgid ""
"MCP secrets are sensitive. Keep them in the secret storage supported by "
"the configuration flow. Do not put them in ordinary settings files or "
"logs."
msgstr "MCP secret 属于敏感信息。请将其保存在配置流程支持的 secret store 中。不要将它们放入普通设置文件或日志。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:22
msgid ""
"The MCP list shows whether a server is **Connected**, **Starting**, "
"**Failed**, or **Disabled**, and how many tools it exposes. A failed "
"connection does not necessarily mean the server's command is wrong; check"
" its URL, transport, environment, and startup output. Deleting a server "
"also removes its stored secrets, so recreate the configuration only when "
"you intend to."
msgstr "MCP 列表会显示 server 是 **Connected**、**Starting**、**Failed** 还是 **Disabled**，以及它提供多少工具。连接失败不一定意味着 server 命令错误；请检查 URL、传输方式、环境和启动输出。删除 server 也会删除其保存的 secret，因此只有在确实打算这样做时才重新创建配置。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:29
msgid "Skills"
msgstr "Skill"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:31
msgid ""
"Skills provide reusable instructions and workflows. Project and personal "
"Skills are instructions, not permissions: they cannot grant tools, escape"
" the workspace, or bypass the approval policy."
msgstr "Skill 提供可复用的指令和工作流。项目 Skill 和个人 Skill 是指令，而不是权限：它们不能授予工具、逃离工作区或绕过审批策略。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:35
msgid ""
"Manage Skills from **Settings > Skills**. A project Skill belongs to the "
"workspace and a personal Skill is available to you across projects. "
"Review a Skill's contents before enabling it, especially when it asks for"
" external services or broad file access."
msgstr "从 **Settings > Skills** 管理 Skill。项目 Skill 属于工作区，个人 Skill 可跨项目使用。启用 Skill 前请审查其内容，尤其是它要求使用外部服务或广泛文件访问时。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:40
msgid ""
"Skills can be built-in, personal, or project-scoped. You can install one "
"from a folder or ZIP, import available global Codex Skills, edit its "
"``SKILL.md``, and delete it. Project Skills are stored under the selected"
" source folder's ``.github/skills`` directory and therefore appear as "
"project changes. Personal Skills live in your user directory and are "
"available across projects."
msgstr "Skill 可以是内置、个人或项目范围的。你可以从文件夹或 ZIP 安装 Skill，导入可用的全局 Codex Skill，编辑其 ``SKILL.md``，或删除它。项目 Skill 保存在选定源文件夹的 ``.github/skills`` 目录下，因此会显示为项目变更。个人 Skill 位于用户目录中，可以跨项目使用。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:46
msgid ""
"Studio validates the Skill's frontmatter, instructions, and file size "
"before saving. An invalid Skill is not a usable Skill. The Skill can "
"describe a workflow, but it cannot grant itself permissions or bypass "
"approvals."
msgstr "Studio 会在保存前验证 Skill 的 frontmatter、指令和文件大小。无效 Skill 不可使用。Skill 可以描述工作流，但不能自行授予权限或绕过审批。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:51
msgid "Browser"
msgstr "浏览器"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:53
msgid ""
"The integrated browser can be configured from **Settings > Browser**. "
"Browser automation is an external side effect: review the target page, "
"credentials, downloads, and actions before approving a run. Keep private "
"browser profiles separate from project work whenever possible."
msgstr "可以从 **Settings > Browser** 配置集成浏览器。浏览器自动化会产生外部副作用：批准运行前，请审查目标页面、凭据、下载和操作。请尽可能将私密浏览器配置文件与项目工作分开。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:59
msgid "Offline Godot documentation"
msgstr "离线 Godot 文档"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:61
msgid ""
"Use **Settings > Documentation** to install an official Godot "
"documentation branch, build its local search index, enable search, repair"
" an unhealthy index, or remove a version you no longer need. Offline "
"documentation is useful when you want the agent to verify Godot APIs "
"without web access."
msgstr "使用 **Settings > Documentation** 安装官方 Godot 文档分支、构建本地搜索索引、启用搜索、修复不健康的索引，或移除不再需要的版本。当你希望 agent 在没有网页访问的情况下验证 Godot API 时，离线文档很有用。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:66
msgid ""
"Installation can download, extract, index, validate, and roll back. Let "
"the operation finish or use the provided cancellation action; do not "
"manually delete a partially indexed directory while Studio is running."
msgstr "安装过程可能包括下载、解压、建立索引、验证和回滚。请等待操作完成，或使用提供的取消操作；Studio 运行时不要手动删除部分建立索引的目录。"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:71
msgid "Development environments and hooks"
msgstr "开发环境和 Hook"

#: ../../source/settings/integrations.rst:73
msgid ""
"Development environments and Hooks have their own detailed guide in :doc"
":`workspace-tools`. In both cases, treat setup scripts, lifecycle "
"commands, and hook commands as code execution. Review the command, "
"network behavior, failure policy, and files it can touch before enabling "
"it."
msgstr "开发环境和 Hook 在 :doc:`workspace-tools` 中有各自的详细指南。无论哪一种，都应将设置脚本、生命周期命令和 Hook 命令视为代码执行。启用前，请审查命令、网络行为、失败策略以及它可能触及的文件。"
